OL,3,GNEWSAStudents' meal deal society goes
OL,4,Aviral after supermarket trip
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the age of social media, few
OL,7,Flunch-time topics spark as much debate
OL,8,Fas the humble meal deal.
OL,10,FShould you choose a sandwich, pasta pot
OL,11,For sushi as your main? Is a bag of
OL,12,Fcrisps the best snack, or can a
OL,13,Fchocolate bar offer better value? And
OL,14,Fwhat drink gives you the most for your
OL,15,Fmoney?
OL,17,FAt the University of Birmingham, those
OL,18,Fquestions have inspired an entire
OL,19,Fstudent society dedicated to
OL,20,Fdiscussing, buying and enjoying meal
OL,21,Fdeals.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
