OL,3,GNEWSAStudents' meal deal society goes
OL,4,Aviral after supermarket trip
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Meal Deal Society was originally
OL,7,Ffounded before the Covid-19 pandemic
OL,8,Fbut gradually faded away. Now it has
OL,9,Fbeen revived for the new academic year
OL,10,Fand has quickly attracted a following.
